{"name": "Totopia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras_big/27d7c10d356c94dae8cccaacb98a69bc.webp?t=1781123879\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/27d7c10d356c94dae8cccaacb98a69bc.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your do-it-all party hub has arrived! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you\u2019re a party-game champ, a Bitrot-smashing hero, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">a master barista, or just a chill fisher, the stage is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Link up with the squad for chaotic game nights or rule the streets of Pulse Avenue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2014there are zero limits to your digital life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2427d37a092aec7a48e140a4f07016a2.poster.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2427d37a092aec7a48e140a4f07016a2.webm?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2427d37a092aec7a48e140a4f07016a2.mp4?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras_big/3bb1c7303dcc4c9b3af3e599934025b9.webp?t=1781123879\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/3bb1c7303dcc4c9b3af3e599934025b9.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Main character energy only!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From drip that hits different to wild, custom fits, express your unique aesthetic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and show the whole world your signature look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/a6adbfbd89cf03706be7ddf6b17a82a8.poster.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/a6adbfbd89cf03706be7ddf6b17a82a8.webm?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/a6adbfbd89cf03706be7ddf6b17a82a8.mp4?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras_big/97ce2cfa780c484c35c9387a91bd328c.webp?t=1781123879\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/97ce2cfa780c484c35c9387a91bd328c.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rise to stardom and become the GOAT!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drop into chaotic brawls, epic races, or team up with the squad to catch that W. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From solo trials to co-op madness, every map is a new chance to hit peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/48d834328f58ac019402991f6af41bab.poster.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/48d834328f58ac019402991f6af41bab.webm?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/48d834328f58ac019402991f6af41bab.mp4?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras_big/b521e4bec5fada2e706fd795be1ce92e.webp?t=1781123879\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/b521e4bec5fada2e706fd795be1ce92e.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Power up with a twist!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use the Soulsync mechanic to bond with your companions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">unlocking cracked abilities and secret tricks to outplay the challenge levels and competitions in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/57492d8277faeb0162bdea4de581544d.poster.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/57492d8277faeb0162bdea4de581544d.webm?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/57492d8277faeb0162bdea4de581544d.mp4?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras_big/64f371fb3b3d503d51ae26506825b57c.webp?t=1781123879\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/64f371fb3b3d503d51ae26506825b57c.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Live your best life on Pulse Avenue!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strike up a convo with quirky Atomons, go fishing, farm your heart out, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or build a dream base that's 100% you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It\u2019s all about the chill vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2b093c64960ab7ba6d88226b142c1098.poster.avif?t=1781123879\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2b093c64960ab7ba6d88226b142c1098.webm?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/extras/2b093c64960ab7ba6d88226b142c1098.mp4?t=1781123879\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Totopia is calling! Drip in your style and crush 100+ chaotic maps, or smash the Bitrot crisis with Atomon skills! Need a recharge? Visit Pulse Avenue to build, plant, or run a cozy cafe. Cast your fishline, chill, and vibe with quirky Atomons. Your world, your way\u2014join the squad and catch that W!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897280/b6d4fb0932593cf5d61291c5eeab6e5e8fb7139b/header.jpg?t=1781123879", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Free to Play", "Party Game", "Multiplayer", "Online Co-Op", "Simulation", "RPG"], "developers": "JNG Studio", "publishers": "JNG Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3897280", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QDYPk5q-_LE", "first_seen": 1776895200.0, "review_rank": 803}